        "body_en": "<p>Our multidisciplinary team combines expertise in motor systems, adaptive AI, biomechanics, human-machine interaction, and wearable robotics to advance human augmentation.</p><p>Through long-term collaborations with leading university research labs, our dual-core technology platform leverages decades of expertise in motor control systems and human-machine intelligence — transforming advanced robotics into wearable technology that helps people move farther, explore more, and experience greater freedom.</p>",
